1. **1 Project = 1 Cell & 3-Tier K8s (`20-*`):** Separate `signal-web` (`pool-web`, Angular `v22+` + Node `26 LTS+`), HA FastAPI `signal-api` + Envoy `signal-engine-bridge` (`pool-api`), & `1–4 -> N` `pool-rust-engine` nodes (Rust `1.100+` `signal-cell-wasm` or Kata/`CONFIDENTIAL_SILICON` + Exclusive `H100 CC`/`B200 TEE-I/O` MIG); Postgres `19+` RLS (`NOBYPASSRLS`), Hybrid PQC DEK/SVID, Cilium 100% lateral drop, uniform `404`, epoch-fenced Rust `signal-egress-proxy`.
2. **Rust `1.100+` Owns Physics, CAD/CAM & Manufacturing:** Zero SPICE, magnetics, creepage, EMC/FMEDA, B-Rep CAD, CNC/3D slicing, DRC/LVS, routing, ECO, or Gerber/GDSII/STEP/G-code/3MF logic in FastAPI or Angular.
3. **Zero Local Files & No Browser Export/Print:** Never store IP in `localStorage`/`sessionStorage`/`IndexedDB`/SW or expose `/export`/`/download`/`/print`. All manufacturing/CNC/3D-print/MCAD/ECN/MCN bundles egress ONLY via Step-Up 2FA write-only Rust `russh` SFTP.
4. **BYO-Git, Padmé Vault & Universal Parts (`18-*`):** Customer owns repos (`GitHub`/`GitLab`/`Bitbucket`: `<project>-meta` + lazy `<project>-<type>` by `provider_repo_id`) + `<org>/signal-org-parts` AVL under Padmé `AES-256-GCM-SIV` + Dual-Fenced 2PC `Super-Commit`; never leak NDA parts into Global CAS.
5. **Contract-First `bigint` & Unified Releases (`20-*`):** All 64-bit contract fields (`_nm`, `_ps`, `fencing_epoch`) use `[jstype = JS_STRING]` → ES2020 `bigint` (`longAsBigint: true`) & exact Python `int`; build-time codegen ONLY. Single `./signal.sh` → stdlib Python `scripts/signal_ops.py` + `components.toml` drives local & thin CI/CD (`VERSION`, auto Release Notes, `N-2` compat, LTS pinning, SLSA L3/Cosign, rollback, Expand-and-Contract SQL).
6. **Zero-Bypass Local Dev:** `dev-guest-auth` (`local-guest-0001`) executes full RBAC + crypto and MUST fail compilation in release/staging builds.

## 3. Token Efficiency, 2–3 Sentence Replies, Clean UI & Anti-Hallucination
- **2–3 Sentence Dev Replies:** During coding/fixes, reply in **2–3 sentences max** (`Issue -> Fix -> Verification`); omit recaps unless asked.
- **Zero-Hallucination:** Verify paths, symbols, deps (`Cargo.toml`/`package.json`/`pyproject.toml`), & contracts via `rg`/`view_file`; claim pass ONLY on exit `0`; never invent pinouts/SI constants; stop/ask or log `BLOCKED_ON_CONTRACT` on ambiguity.
- **Clean Modularity & UI:** Files `<= 300 LOC`, functions `<= 40 LOC`, nesting `<= 3`, 3-line header; Angular `v22+` splits `.component.ts`/`.html` (`<= 150 LOC`, zero `@if`-soup/duplication)/`.logic.ts`/`.model.ts` with centralized `@signal/design-system` + `@signal/ui-kit` (NO per-component CSS unless `@sig-style-exception`).
